+## Initialisation and Privacy
+
+- `init` creates a bounded, deterministic, non-semantic baseline from verified root package metadata, a bounded root directory snapshot, and workflow filenames. It does not traverse source directories or generate language counts or regular-file totals; agents may discover these separately.
